ms the tasks.md block \"Verifier follow-ups, coordinator\" names, or a pass-one or pass-two finding whose fix holds. Every finding is P0, P1 or P2 with file:line and a concrete input that shows it. A finding without a concrete input is not a finding. HARD RULE: never open, read, print or diff .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/holdout-prompts.jsonl, and never read rows of command-prompts.jsonl whose split is holdout. One commit deleted one line of that sealed file: check it only with `git -c core.fsmonitor=false diff --numstat ec1869dae8..HEAD -- <that path>`, which must print 0 added and 1 deleted. The reviewer changes no code and writes only inside its lineage folder. Run tests as `env -u AI_SESSION_CHILD npx vitest run <file>` from .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime, or `node --test <file>` for .cjs tests, single files only. Do not run a build, the full suite, a daemon or a model CLI.\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"cat \\\"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-michelkerkmeester-MEGA-Development-Skilled/c9fe91ef-9b85-4bdc-88fb-4d6f766eaecf/scratchpad/review-instructions-3.txt\\\"\"}"},"time":{"start":1794593431091,"end":1794593432255}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794593432262,"sessionID":"ses_e29e5c0b9ffed1u4GCgcaPeWZq","part":{"partID":"prt_1d61aa017001bpym0hvsFBF6j4","sessionID":"ses_e29e5c0b9ffed1u4GCgcaPeWZq","messageID":"msg_1d61a7e370017UfYvtRRWp5suj","type":"tool","id":"call_d3dc5cd1f9844124976314cd","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"ls -la specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/doctor-docs-3/ 2>/dev/null; echo \"---\"; ls specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/ 2>/dev/null"},"output":"total 8\ndrwx------@  8 michelkerkmeester  staff  256 Nov 13 19:10 .\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 12 michelkerkmeester  staff  384 Nov 13 19:10 ..\ndrwxr-xr-x@  2 michelkerkmeester  staff   64 Nov 13 19:10 .executor-state\ndrwxr-xr-x@  3 michelkerkmeester  staff   96 Nov 13 19:10 containment\ndrwx------@  7 michelkerkmeester  staff  224 Nov 13 19:10 deep-review-audit-ledger\ndrwx------@  7 michelkerkmeester  staff  224 Nov 13 19:10 deep-review-effect-ledger\n-rw-r--r--@  1 michelkerkmeester  staff  430 Nov 13 19:10 invocation-metadata.json\ndrwxr-xr-x@  3 michelkerkmeester  staff   96 Nov 13 19:10 locks-and-fencing-v1\n---\naccuracy-runner\naccuracy-runner-2\nadvisor-runtime-3\ndoctor-docs-3\ndoctor-install\ndoctor-install-2\nrender-hooks-plugin\nrender-hooks-plugin-2\nscorer-attach\nscorer-attach-2\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"total 8\ndrwx------@  8 michelkerkmeester  staff  256 Nov 13 19:10 .\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 12 michelkerkmeester  staff  384 Nov 13 19:10 ..\ndrwxr-xr-x@  2 michelkerkmeester  staff   64 Nov 13 19:10 .executor-state\ndrwxr-xr-x@  3 michelkerkmeester  staff   96 Nov 13 19:10 containment\ndrwx------@  7 michelkerkmeester  staff  224 Nov 13 19:10 deep-review-audit-ledger\ndrwx------@  7 michelkerkmeester  staff  224 Nov 13 19:10 deep-review-effect-ledger\n-rw-r--r--@  1 michelkerkmeester  staff  430 Nov 13 19:10 invocation-metadata.json\ndrwxr-xr-x@  3 michelkerkmeester  staff   96 Nov 13 19:10 locks-and-fencing-v1\n---\naccuracy-runner\naccuracy-runner-2\nadvisor-runtime-3\ndoctor-docs-3\ndoctor-install\ndoctor-install-2\nrender-hooks-plugin\nrender-hooks-plugin-2\nscorer-attach\nscorer-attach-2\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"ls -la specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/doctor-docs-3/ 2>/dev/null; echo \\\"---\\\"; ls specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/ 2>/dev/null\"}"},"time":{"start":1794593431575,"end":1794593432262}}}}
