{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794593757865,"sessionID":"ses_e29e5c0b9ffed1u4GCgcaPeWZq","part":{"partID":"prt_1d61f968c001gnYrl8CV15pZNG","sessionID":"ses_e29e5c0b9ffed1u4GCgcaPeWZq","messageID":"msg_1d61f7335001UxoVeai9bwoz4J","type":"tool","id":"call_dc5543e0103041b6bcea8c88","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"rg -n \"holdoutSha256\" .skilled --glob '!**/node_modules/**' --glob '!**/dist/**' | head -10; echo ===; rg -n \"trustedCheckout|lineFixture|armFor\\(\" .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/*.mjs | head -20"},"output":".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md:128:| `holdout-prompts.jsonl` | Frozen holdout first written by `build-holdout.mjs` from three separately authored fixtures disjoint from the labeled corpus, and read by `capture-scorer-eval-baseline.mjs` as its unseen split. The file has been edited by hand since it was sealed, so `build-holdout.mjs --write` would now write a different set of rows. A sealed row is retired by deleting its line and recapturing `scorer-eval-baseline.json`, whose `holdoutSha256` fails the ratchet until that recapture runs. |\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/capture-scorer-eval-baseline.mjs:221:  holdoutSha256: sha256File(HOLDOUT_JSONL),\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/scorer-eval-baseline.json:6:  \"holdoutSha256\": \"sha256:51cb48eb8b10e501fd8536eb403deb7674583f89adc5418c1cb583c5c6b02d6a\",\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/parity/scorer-eval-baseline-ratchet.vitest.ts:42:  readonly holdoutSha256: string;\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/parity/scorer-eval-baseline-ratchet.vitest.ts:248:    expect(sha256File(HOLDOUT_PATH), 'holdout changed — re-baseline').toBe(BASELINE.holdoutSha256);\n===\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs:806:export function lineFixture(line, fallback) {\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs:989:export function armFor(options, rowIds) {\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs:1248:    promptFor: (rowId, line) => promptFor(rowId, lineFixture(line, fixture)),\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs:1262:    options.arm = armFor(options, rowIds);\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-offer.mjs:336:export function trustedCheckout(checkoutDir) {\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-offer.mjs:403:  trusted = trustedCheckout,\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md:128:| `holdout-prompts.jsonl` | Frozen holdout first written by `build-holdout.mjs` from three separately authored fixtures disjoint from the labeled corpus, and read by `capture-scorer-eval-baseline.mjs` as its unseen split. The file has been edited by hand since it was sealed, so `build-holdout.mjs --write` would now write a different set of rows. A sealed row is retired by deleting its line and recapturing `scorer-eval-baseline.json`, whose `holdoutSha256` fails the ratchet until that recapture runs. |\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/capture-scorer-eval-baseline.mjs:221:  holdoutSha256: sha256File(HOLDOUT_JSONL),\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/scorer-eval-baseline.json:6:  \"holdoutSha256\": \"sha256:51cb48eb8b10e501fd8536eb403deb7674583f89adc5418c1cb583c5c6b02d6a\",\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/parity/scorer-eval-baseline-ratchet.vitest.ts:42:  readonly holdoutSha256: string;\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/parity/scorer-eval-baseline-ratchet.vitest.ts:248:    expect(sha256File(HOLDOUT_PATH), 'holdout changed — re-baseline').toBe(BASELINE.holdoutSha256);\n===\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs:806:export function lineFixture(line, fallback) {\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs:989:export function armFor(options, rowIds) {\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs:1248:    promptFor: (rowId, line) => promptFor(rowId, lineFixture(line, fixture)),\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs:1262:    options.arm = armFor(options, rowIds);\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-offer.mjs:336:export function trustedCheckout(checkoutDir) {\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-offer.mjs:403:  trusted = trustedCheckout,\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"rg -n \\\"holdoutSha256\\\" .skilled --glob '!**/node_modules/**' --glob '!**/dist/**' | head -10; echo ===; rg -n \\\"trustedCheckout|lineFixture|armFor\\\\(\\\" .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/*.mjs | head -20\"}"},"time":{"start":1794593756812,"end":1794593757865}}}}
